    <unit id="SemanticPartIconDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The icon region presents the leading or trailing icon and its loading replacement.</source>
        <target state="translated">图标区域展示起始或末尾图标，以及加载状态下的替代图标。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The Button root owns interaction states, background, border, and overall layout.</source>
        <target state="translated">Button 根区域承载交互状态、背景、边框和整体布局。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Use owner-scoped selectors and Button state selectors to customize published Semantic Parts.</source>
        <target state="translated">使用所有者作用域选择器和 Button 状态选择器，自定义已发布的 Semantic Part。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Custom Semantic Part styling</source>
        <target state="translated">自定义语义结构的样式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SizeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>AtomUI supports three sizes of buttons: small, default and large. If a large or small button is desired, set the size property to either large or small respectively. Omit the size property for a button with the default size.</source>
        <target state="translated">AtomUI 支持小号、默认和大号三种按钮尺寸。需要大号或小号按钮时可设置 size 属性；省略 size 属性时使用默认尺寸。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
